 <h3><u>Madine ka musafir hu</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya Mohammad.. Ya Mohammad..(5)<br> Madina kab bhala firdaus se kam hai kisi surat<br> ye hai wo raaz jo humko farishto ne bataya hai<br> meri qismat pe naaza hai muqaddar saari duniya ke<br> mere sarkaar ne mujhko watan apne bulaya hai<br> madiney ka musafir hu..(4)</p> 
  <p>Salaam un paak rasto'n par jaha'n sarkaar guzre hai<br> salaam un paak galiyo'n par jaha'n hasnain(a.s.) khele hai<br> dare zehra(s.a.) jaha'n aakar, farishte bheekh lete hai<br> unhi rasto'n, unhi galiyo'n, usi darr ka mujawir hu,</p> 
  <p>Aye zawwaro'n Mohammad(s.a.w.w.) ke, tumhe sar par uthaunga<br> tumhe raste mein mai sarkaar ki naatein sunaunga<br> jo thak kar baith jao tum, mai payro ko dabaunga<br> mere ham raah ho jao, mai har khidmat ko hazir hu</p> 
  <p>Baqayya jaate hi khudko zamee'n par mai giraunga<br> nabi ki aal ki gurbat pe mai aasu bahaunga<br> masaeb aale ahmed ke mai duniya ko sunaunga<br> tadapta hai ye dil kitna, mai batlane se qasir hu</p> 
  <p>Madiney jaake mai sarkaar ki mehfil sajaunga<br> mai khud sarkaar ko sarkaar ki naatein sunaunga<br> pakad kar jaaliya'n unse sanad bakhshish ki paunga<br> karam farhan par kar dein mere aaqa mai zaaer hu<br> madiney ka musafir hu..(4)</p> 
